<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:23:16 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>这位前海豹突击队员在私募股权行业工作了 5 年，每周工作 100 小时，然后辞职并创立了一家价值 90 亿美元的初创公司</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/saronic-ceo-dino-mavrookas-former-navy-seal-private-equity-career-pivot-now-built-nine-billion-defense-tech-startup/</link><description>迪诺·马夫鲁卡斯 (Dino Mavrookas) 从海豹突击队转到私募股权公司，后来辞职创立了 Saronic，该公司现已成为一家价值 92.5 亿美元的公司。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2285600473-e1789050871933.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:53:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/saronic-ceo-dino-mavrookas-former-navy-seal-private-equity-career-pivot-now-built-nine-billion-defense-tech-startup/</guid></item><item><title>共和党主要捐助者对特朗普在中期大会上的 5,000 美元“面包和马戏团贿赂”犹豫不决</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/republicans-trump-5000-bribe-midterms/</link><description>特朗普还在漫长的黄金时段演讲中承认，“现任总统不应该赢得中期选举”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26253112886363-e1789048172920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:37:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/republicans-trump-5000-bribe-midterms/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普试图贿赂美国人投票共和党，承诺支付 5,000 美元股息——前提是共和党获胜</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-5000-dividend-republicans-midterms-us-debt/</link><description>这些付款可能花费超过 1 万亿美元，并且需要国会批准，而关税收入却远远不够。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26253083157236-e1789047222242.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:52:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-5000-dividend-republicans-midterms-us-debt/</guid></item><item><title>微软在人工智能学校辩论中的举措：控制学生数据的使用方式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/microsoft-school-district-ai-standard-enforceable-safety/</link><description>兰迪·温加滕 (Randi Weingarten) 表示，OpenAI 和 Anthropic 已“表达了意愿”，微软将为每个学区提供人工智能隐私标准。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2262181855_b59b53-e1788900325601.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 19:41:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/microsoft-school-district-ai-standard-enforceable-safety/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的“美丽大法案”预计将在未来十年使国家债务增加 3.4 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-big-beautiful-bill-taxes-debt/</link><description>但美国人今年平均确实又获得了 350 美元的退税。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26245859523879-e1789045918639.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:36:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-big-beautiful-bill-taxes-debt/</guid></item><item><title>他的家人带着 1 卢布逃离了苏联。现在，亿万富翁伊戈尔·图尔钦斯基 (Igor Tulchinsky) 支持 2026 年欧洲最大的展览</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/igor-tulchinsky-soviet-union-bayeux-tapestry-exhibition/</link><description>图尔钦斯基向大英博物馆捐赠了 680 万美元，以支持这次展览，查尔斯国王称其为“非凡的艺术品”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260907_BRITISHMUSEUM_SHOT_02_098-f1png-1.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 11:50:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/igor-tulchinsky-soviet-union-bayeux-tapestry-exhibition/</guid></item><item><title>随着学校应对读写能力危机，富裕的父母正在为孩子购买 75,000 美元的带护栏的人工智能教育</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/alpha-school-wealthy-parents-ai-school/</link><description>由于全国学校的阅读成绩都处于历史低位，阿尔法学校设有人工智能辅导核心科目和专门用于生活技能研讨会的下午。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-163892249-e1788981448696.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 07:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/alpha-school-wealthy-parents-ai-school/</guid></item><item><title>为了纪念唐纳德·特朗普，“南方公园”更名为“南美洲”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/south-park-renamed-south-america-in-honor-of-donald-trump/</link><description>继制图竞争对手谷歌之后，苹果公司为其地图应用程序的美国用户将安大略湖重新标记为“美国湖”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26252682989364-e1789046214424.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:17:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/south-park-renamed-south-america-in-honor-of-donald-trump/</guid></item><item><title>“家长更多地将自己视为学校的客户”：课堂表现不佳导致家庭冷漠</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/pisa-2025-us-sampling-gap-scores/</link><description>40% 的无答复率意味着 OECD 今年无法按种族或收入列出美国有史以来最差的 PISA 阅读成绩。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26251800244503.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:15:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/pisa-2025-us-sampling-gap-scores/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 9 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-09-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-Sep-9.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-09-2026/</guid></item></channel></rss>